expense related to the options for the year ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, was $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="cref_687830500" unitRef="uref_82683962" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-9277">1,166,989</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="cref_1171682388" unitRef="uref_82683962" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-9278">665,058</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. As of June 30, 2026 there was approximately $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedStockOptions" contextRef="cref_1849970678" unitRef="uref_82683962" scale="6" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-9279">1</ix:nonFraction> million of unrecognized compensation cost related to the options, which is expected to be recognized over a remaining weighted-average vesting period of approximately <ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedPeriodForRecognition1" contextRef="cref_687830500" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="ixv-9280">0.74</ix:nonNumeric> years. </p> <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p> <ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfShareBasedPaymentAwardEmployeeStockPurchasePlanValuationAssumptionsTableTextBlock" contextRef="cref_687830500" escape="true" id="ixv-6558"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify;">During the year ended June 30, 2026, the significant assumptions used in the calculation of grant date fair value of the stock options are as follows:</p> <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; background-color: white;">&#160;</p> <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: