mmarized as follows:</p> <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p> <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-weight: bold;"><span style="text-decoration:underline">Year Ended June 30, 2026</span></span></p> <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0;">&#160;</p> <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;"> <tbody><tr style="vertical-align: bottom;"><td>&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td colspan="2" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">&#160;</span></td> <td>&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td colspan="2" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Weighted</span></td> <td>&#160;</td> </tr><tr style="vertical-align: bottom;"><td>&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td colspan="2" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Number of</span></td> <td>&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td colspan="2" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Average</span></td> <td>&#160;</td> </tr><tr style="vertical-align: bottom;"><td>&#160;</td> <td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt;">&#160;</td> <td colspan="2" style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: center;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Warrants</span></td> <td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt;">&#160;</td> <td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt;">&#160;</td> <td colspan="2" style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: center;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Exercise&#160;Price</span></td> <td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt;">&#160;</td> </tr><tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255);"> <td style="width: 76%;">Warrants outstanding at June 30, 2025</td> <td style="width: 1%;">&#160;</td> <td style="width: 1%; text-align: left;">&#160;</td> <td style="width: 9%; text-align: right;"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Sh